The workflow of the pipeline include the following steps:
1. Calculate co-accessibility between enhancers of a given gene
2. Restructure the format of the file that contains significant enhancers of the target gene
3. Construct a network of highly correlated enhancers of the target gene
4. TE intersection with significant enhancer sequences of the target gene
5. Generate a TE-family-enahcner matrix and a TE-family-location-based TE-enahcner matrix as output
